        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "New UK Prime Minister Andy Burnham’s Labour party currently commands about a 25% share of votes in public opinion polls, overtaking Reform UK, now on 24%, for the first time since April 2025, according to the FT’s poll tracker.  https:// ft.trib.al/QlZvd06",
