          "interaction": 512
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Opinion: On the surface, the dispute was simply about the governance of the world’s most popular sport. But the geopolitical subtext is unmissable.  https:// ft.trib.al/IJvzXgB",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2084315624528863506",
