          "interaction": 335
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "A top Fifa executive has described Gianni Infantino's failed attempt to bring in outside investors as a 'reproachable series of events' that has thrown football’s governing body into 'turmoil'.  https:// ft.trib.al/rY0WhdM",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2084669963789296020",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T23:57:05.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 246
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "ASML’s hold over the future of chipmaking is weakening  https:// ft.trib.al/pC3ckTi  | opinion",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2084269134200594709",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T21:24:20.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 244
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "What has happened to the 60,000 migrants who crossed into Ceuta from Morocco? Malaika Kanaaneh Tapper reports on the mass migration attempt that left at least 72 people dead and many still missing.  https:// ft.trib.al/aNJ3iX0",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2084179536942436575",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T15:28:18.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 240
