        {
          "handle": "SemiAnalysis_",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Google has open-sourced their TPU Raiden inference optimization library. This is the equivalent layer of the stack to NVIDIA NIXL, where it provides KVCache transfer between prefill & decode instances & has primitives for KVCache offloading movements! It is great to see Google",
          "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2086241160243118556",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-09T08:00:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 1109
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "• MI500 expected to outperform Nvidia’s Rubin Ultra in hardware performance",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084934092047745252",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T17:26:38.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 549
        },
        {
          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Today in Armenia,  @FirebirdCloudAI  announced the launch of the CIS region's largest AI factory, designed to bring global demand for AI infrastructure, local development opportunities and new economic growth to the region.  Powered by NVIDIA accelerated computing with  @Dell  and",
          "url": "https://x.com/nvidianewsroom/status/2086036542502384018",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-08T18:27:23.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 400
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "ZDNet Korea reports that prices for NVIDIA’s GeForce RTX 50-series graphics cards in South Korea will rise by up to 30% starting this month.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084178225874473196",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T15:23:05.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 232
        },
        {
          "handle": "FT",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "FT Exclusive: The company, founded in 2024 by the 25-year-old entrepreneur, has sought new funding in an effort to outpace the many rival start-ups vying to compete against Nvidia in the booming AI infrastructure market.  https:// ft.trib.al/BULHZO9",
          "url": "https://x.com/FT/status/2084240402391900545",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T19:30:09.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 217
        },
        {
          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "NVIDIA is joining  @NSF ’s new $100M State and Regional AI Infrastructure Hubs program to expand access to advanced computing, data, software, and expertise.  Together, we can help accelerate research, strengthen AI education, & prepare students for the AI economy.",
          "url": "https://x.com/nvidianewsroom/status/2084675932074192915",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T00:20:48.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 148
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AI 推動光互連需求暴增，磷化銦（InP）成為算力擴張瓶頸。Lumentum 五座 InP 廠出貨仍低於需求逾30%，SemiAnalysis 指出 CPO 用 CW DFB 雷射特別短缺。  核心警告 Lumentum CEO Hurlston 在巴黎 RAISE 高峰會明確表示：InP 短缺將比記憶體危機更嚴重。即使與競爭對手合計，也無法滿足 Nvidia",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2084317764232351904",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T00:37:34.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 134
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Wells Fargo：Nvidia NVL72 物料清單  整體成本比較 - 每機架總成本：Vera Rubin NVL72 估計為 8,341,971 美元，相較於 GB300 NVL72（4,234,524 美元）增加了 97%（總變化約 4,234,524 美元）。 - 每 GW（IT 功耗）總成本：Vera Rubin 擴展至 61,895M 美元，相較於 GB300 的 50,101M 美元，增加了",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2084673525986832596",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T00:11:14.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 132
        }
      ]
